			"notes": "This is a **BETA** release of Hide-n-Seek to the public. This is meant to be a test build for people to give feedback and find bugs. \n\nFeatures:\n- /hide-n-seek command for ops\n- fully customizable events json (see examples after running the server)\n- config for adjusting game values\n- easy to use command system for quick startup\n- multi-seeker support\n- compass hider tracking\n\n**This mod overrides many vanilla aspects of the game, don't use this in a normal survival world!**\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Tater-Certified/Hide-n-Seek/commits/0.0.0"
